SHOT TYPE GUIDELINES FOR 10-15 MINUTE EPISODES
Pacing Mix (Recommended Distribution):
* Establishing Shots (Wide/Extreme Wide): 15% - Set location, context
* Medium Shots: 35% - Primary storytelling workhorse
* Close-Ups: 30% - Emotional connection, reactions
* Insert Shots (Details): 10% - Objects, texts, hands, symbolic elements
* Dynamic Shots (POV, Dutch, Tracking): 10% - Visual variety, subjective perspective
Shot Duration Guidelines:
* Establishing shots: 5-8 seconds
* Dialogue-driven shots: 8-15 seconds
* Reaction shots: 3-6 seconds
* Insert shots: 2-4 seconds
* Transition/montage shots: 3-5 seconds
